Subject: [PATCH] rtc: 88pm80x: fix unintended sign extension
Date:   Wed,  6 Feb 2019 10:08:11 +0000
Message-Id: <20190206100811.13315-1-colin.king@canonical.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.20.1
MIME-Version: 1.0
